- TYPE: Parent
  VALUE: IA-NBK-008

[REQUIREMENT]
UID: IA-SCN-DCH-CP
STATUS: Active
TITLE: Constant-power discharge
STATEMENT: >>>
Apply a constant discharge power command.
<<<
COMMENT: >>>
Power tracks the discharge setpoint until a voltage or SOC limit.
<<<
