UID: IA-SCN-DCH-PARTIAL
STATUS: Active
TITLE: Partial discharge
STATEMENT: >>>
Discharge from a high SOC to an intermediate SOC.
<<<
COMMENT: >>>
Final SOC matches the scheduled stop within tolerance.
<<<
RELATIONS:
- TYPE: Parent
  VALUE: IA-NBK-008

[REQUIREMENT]
UID: IA-SCN-DCH-DEEP
STATUS: Active
