- TYPE: Parent
  VALUE: IA-NBK-008

[REQUIREMENT]
UID: IA-SCN-DCH-HIGHRATE
STATUS: Active
TITLE: High-rate discharge
STATEMENT: >>>
Discharge at a high C-rate relative to the design current.
<<<
COMMENT: >>>
Overpotential and heat generation exceed the low-rate case.
<<<
RELATIONS:
- TYPE: Parent
  VALUE: IA-NBK-008

[REQUIREMENT]
UID: IA-SCN-DCH-LOWRATE
STATUS: Active
TITLE: Low-rate discharge
STATEMENT: >>>
Discharge at a low C-rate.
<<<
COMMENT: >>>
Voltage remains closer to Nernst than the high-rate case.
<<<
RELATIONS:
- TYPE: Parent
  VALUE: IA-NBK-008

[REQUIREMENT]
UID: IA-SCN-DCH-100H
STATUS: Active
TITLE: 100-hour discharge
STATEMENT: >>>
Discharge energy over a 100-hour window.
<<<
COMMENT: >>>
Simulation spans 3.6e5 s and SOC declines monotonically under a positive discharge load.
<<<
RELATIONS:
- TYPE: Parent
  VALUE: IA-NBK-008

[REQUIREMENT]
UID: IA-SCN-TRN-CHG2DCH
STATUS: Active
