  VALUE: IA-NBK-009

[REQUIREMENT]
UID: IA-SCN-TRN-DCH2CHG
STATUS: Active
TITLE: Discharge to charge
STATEMENT: >>>
Transition from discharge to charge.
<<<
COMMENT: >>>
Current sign reverses. SOC slope changes sign.
