TITLE: Grid voltage sag
STATEMENT: >>>
Apply a grid voltage sag as an external input.
<<<
COMMENT: >>>
Grid voltage is not a fabricated dynamic state when prescribed. Ride-through monitors record the event.
<<<
RELATIONS:
- TYPE: Parent
  VALUE: IA-NBK-014

[REQUIREMENT]
UID: IA-SCN-GRD-SWELL
STATUS: Active
TITLE: Grid voltage swell
STATEMENT: >>>
Apply a grid voltage swell as an external input.
<<<
COMMENT: >>>
Prescribed swell appears in inputs. Inverter reactive response follows the configured Q(V) curve if enabled.
<<<
RELATIONS:
- TYPE: Parent
  VALUE: IA-NBK-014

[REQUIREMENT]
UID: IA-SCN-GRD-UF
STATUS: Active
TITLE: Underfrequency
STATEMENT: >>>
Apply a grid underfrequency input.
<<<
COMMENT: >>>
Frequency is an input unless swing-equation mode is explicitly enabled.
<<<
RELATIONS:
- TYPE: Parent
  VALUE: IA-NBK-014

[REQUIREMENT]
UID: IA-SCN-GRD-OF
STATUS: Active
TITLE: Overfrequency
STATEMENT: >>>
Apply a grid overfrequency input.
<<<
COMMENT: >>>
Frequency-watt reduction of active power occurs when enabled.
<<<
RELATIONS:
- TYPE: Parent
  VALUE: IA-NBK-014

[REQUIREMENT]
UID: IA-SCN-GRD-FW
STATUS: Active
TITLE: Frequency-watt response
STATEMENT: >>>
Exercise P(f) droop.
<<<
COMMENT: >>>
Active power decreases for overfrequency according to the configured droop.
<<<
RELATIONS:
- TYPE: Parent
  VALUE: IA-NBK-014

[REQUIREMENT]
UID: IA-SCN-GRD-VV
STATUS: Active
